      "id": "claim_1f38da4db7cf4e69951fe9c191a3a5b7",
      "statement": "One object-store client speaks two conditional-write dialects (S3/Azure etag If-Match/If-None-Match and GCS x-goog-if-generation-match, because GCS does not apply If-Match to a PUT), and its contract is that put_cas returns Ok(None) only for a clean 412/409 rejection — every other outcome is an ambiguous Err — with a tokenless response treated as an error, which is what the self-fence relies on.",
