      "id": "claim_10e14a81e8c348349721b0d6431874e0",
      "statement": "Graceful shutdown turns health unhealthy and answers new public requests with 503 while finishing accepted ones, hands off in bounded batches (CELLD_RELEASES=8, no-progress gap CEllD_SHUTDOWN_DRAIN_MS=25000 reset by successor acks, total bound CEllD_SHUTDOWN_TOTAL_MS=40000, orchestrator grace required above it), and each donor claims the advisory fleet drain token (CEllD_DRAIN_TOKEN_WAIT_MS=30000, 0 disables) so concurrent stops hand off one node at a time without the token ever being load-bearing.",
